L448: ## The Supreme Master Ching Hai’s Message
L449: I have a dream. I dream that all the world will become peaceful. I dream that all the killing will stop. I dream that all the children will walk in peace and harmony.
L450: I dream that all the nations shake hands with each other, protect each other and help each other. I dream that our beautiful planet will not be destroyed.
L451: It takes billion, billion, trillions of years to produce this planet and it’s so beautiful, so wonderful. I dream that it will continue, but in peace, beauty and love.
